# Used automatically by `vite build` (production mode) on top of `.env` —
# `npm run dev` is untouched and still talks to the real local backend.
#
# This is the one flag that makes the built frontend fully self-contained:
# every feature service already branches on it (see
# docs/architecture/README.md's "Mock data architecture" section), so the
# deployed static build never needs a live backend/database/payment/email
# provider reachable anywhere.
VITE_USE_MOCK_API=true
